oke-linejoin=\"round\" role=\"img\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4221349/wender\" target=\"_blank\" data-label=\"related_btn\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" role=\"img\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_very_large family_lora\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"Wender\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMjY4MjU2LnBuZw==/original/Uj9iui.png\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Wender</h1></div><div class=\"view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top ready\" id=\"view_html_game_6534731\"><div class=\"html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper\" id=\"html_embed_1472875\"><div data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 360px\" class=\"game_frame start_maximized game_pending\"><div class=\"restore_wrapper\"><button class=\"restore_btn button\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" aria-hidden width=\"24\" height=\"24\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" role=\"img\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Restore game</button></div><div data-iframe=\"&lt;iframe mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/19447774/Wender_Web/index.html?v=1790596292&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; scrolling=&quot;no&quot; allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\" class=\"iframe_placeholder\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" aria-hidden width=\"24\" height=\"24\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" role=\"img\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run game</button></div></div></div><div class=\"donate\"><a href=\"https://wizorge.itch.io/wender/purchase\" class=\"button donate_btn\" data-donate=\"false\">Download Now</a></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p><strong><em>DOWNLOAD RECOMMENDED</em></strong><strong><em>&nbsp;FOR BETTER PERFORMANCE</em></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p><strong><em></em></strong></p>\r\n<h1>&quot;So what am I looking at?&quot;</h1>\r\n<p><strong>Wender </strong>is a game about grinding in and exploring strange planes, all the while meeting even stranger characters and having perhaps even more strange things<strong> </strong>happen around you.<br></p>\r\n<h1>&quot;That doesn&#x27;t tell me anything, gimme the deets!&quot;</h1>\r\n<p><strong>Grind Resources and Level Skills</strong></p>\r\n<p>Harvest different kinds of resources with different tools. Trade items with locals to harvest faster and/or do other cool (and maybe even useful!) things.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMjU5MTEyLmdpZg==/original/Doqe9G.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><strong>Feed&nbsp;the Lighthouse</strong></p>\r\n<p>The furnaces haven&#x27;t been tended to for a long time, fuel them to push back the fog and access the higher lighthouse floors.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMjU5MTE5LmdpZg==/original/mTZipj.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><strong>Explore the Planes</strong></p>\r\n<p>Travel across different planes, some tranquil and vibrant, others desolate and liminal. Find ruined temples, abandoned treasures and meet the locals.<br></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMjU5MTI0LmdpZg==/original/7vn7uM.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<h1>Vibes you can expect</h1>\r\n<p><strong>First-person 3D Incremental/Clicker</strong></p>\r\n<p>For people who want to see number go up in 3D or liked the following games&nbsp;<a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3244220/A_Game_About_Digging_A_Hole/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">A Game About Digging A Hole</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3593780/Lumberjacked/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Lumberjacked</a>&nbsp;and <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2237970/Outpath/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Outpath</a>&nbsp;(I recommend checking all three out if you like this sorta thing!).</p>\r\n<p><strong>Uncanny Atmospheric Horror</strong></p>\r\n<p>No gore.&nbsp;Unsettling atmosphere over quantity of jumpscares. The worlds are weird, and they only get weirder when the lighthouse stops working and the fog rolls in.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Surreal Planes Inspired by Early&nbsp;Pre-Rendered 3D</strong></p>\r\n<p>Non-euclidean lighthouse where each floor takes you to a different world. Valleys of bamboo groves surrounded by&nbsp;marble columns. Vast barren deserts filled with ruins, girders and leather couches. Yea, I like Myst, how could you tell?</p>\r\n<h1>Current features</h1>\r\n<ul><li>2-6 hours of gameplay</li><li>8 skills that make you exponentially better at things</li><li>12 resources to harvest, 31 items to gather&nbsp;or process from something else</li><li>Find or unlock and&nbsp;buy better tools and upgrades from locals</li><li>Buy a house</li><li>Explore&nbsp;4 unique planes, find out what&#x27;s still there and what has been left behind</li><li>Collect 7 sets of cards, some with neat rewards (hey did that just sorta rhyme?)</li><li>Spooky stuff happening in the fog</li></ul>\r\n<h1>Features you might see later</h1>\r\n<ul><li>New skills like&nbsp;fishing, farming and&nbsp;building</li><li>New characters with quests and context based dialogue</li><li>Random events, anomalies and new entities to encounter</li><li>A main questline that leads you to the top of the lighthouse and into new places</li><li>So much&nbsp;content that I&#x27;ll need MS Excel to manage it all based on my 1000-line backlog of ideas and player feedback</li></ul>\r\n<h1>Web version issues</h1>\r\n<ul><li>Esc to close pause menu is disabled to reduce issues&nbsp;(use tab or click outside the menu instead)</li><li>One-time freezes during certain moments in the game as the game loads stuff for the first time</li></ul>\r\n<p>Download&nbsp;below for better performance</p>\r\n<h1>Developer notes</h1>\r\n<p>Wender is a game I&#x27;ve been working on solo since around start of 2026. Previously it was called &quot;Out of Light&quot;.&nbsp;Also saves will probably keep breaking until all the core systems are finished, sorry!</p>\r\n<p>I love grindy games that keep the loop fresh with new mechanics and things happening, so having run out of similar games to play, I figured I&#x27;d try to make one myself. Greatly inspired by games like A&nbsp;Game About Digging A&nbsp;Hole, Lumberjacked, Outpath, OSRS and NGU Idle.<br></p>\r\n<p>Feedback on balancing, bugs, unclear mechanics, or anything else (like commenting what was cool or what sucked) is greatly appreciated!</p>\r\n<p>Thanks for checking Wender out!</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" aria-hidden width=\"12\" height=\"6\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\" id=\"game_info_panel_6501466\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title=\"28 September 2026 @ 15:53 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 1 day ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/in-development\">In development</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/html5\">HTML5</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-osx\">macOS</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-linux\">Linux</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div itemprop=\"aggregateRating\" class=\"aggregate_rating\" itemscope tabindex=\"0\" data-tooltip=\"4.64 average rating from 11 total ratings\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/AggregateRating\"><div content=\"4.6\" itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"star_value\"><span class=\"screenreader_only\">Rated 4.6 out of 5 stars</span><div style=\"wid